    given-names: Liam
repository-code: https://github.com/Liam-Son/Lumber-Quant-Engine
license: MIT
version: 3.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-07"
abstract: >
  Open research software for a six-factor pressure and regime model of
  softwood lumber futures. Implements publication lags, expanding-window
  information-coefficient weights, free alternative-data injectors, and
  honest null results on CME LBR=F.
keywords:
  - lumber futures
  - alternative data
  - factor models
  - publication lag
  - information coefficient
